  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 5, 'Pick one corner of your home, even a single chair by a window, and call it your reading spot for this evening.'),
  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 6, 'Look on the box of a lamp bulb you already own and note whether it says warm white, soft white or daylight.'),
