  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 239, 'Group three plants together on one surface to make a small green corner.'),
  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 240, 'Notice where the sun hits your floor in the afternoon and put a cushion there for a short rest.'),
  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 241, 'Leave the curtains open on a winter afternoon so every bit of daylight comes in.'),
