  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 255, 'Hum or sing a song you love while you cook dinner.'),
  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 256, 'Read aloud to someone you live with, or to yourself, by lamplight.'),
  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 257, 'Invite a friend over for tea and set out two mugs and a plate of something simple.'),
