  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 356, 'Plan a meal that makes you feel at home and cook it slowly this weekend.'),
  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 357, 'Write down a smell from your childhood home and find a way to bring it back, a spice, a soap, a flower.'),
  ('making-home-feel-cozy', 358, 'Ask yourself what home felt like at its best and pick one small thing from that memory to bring back.'),
